{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S10—S12等短停留段的感受提示切换较密，容易让观众顾着追踪文字，Y的左右分栏在快速扫读上更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】直接凸显每段叙事的落点，观众容易抓住人物当下最重要的念头；而且感受提示能在音乐走到相应位置时出现，使情绪变化有具体的时间和层次。Y的完整句子更顺畅，人物动机也交代得清楚，但部分音乐与心理之间的细微转折被概括掉了。综合来看，X让观众获得的音乐情绪体验更具体、更细腻，尽管扫读负担略高，我仍选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3a203a9c-19cb-4421-a0b7-52f1fbd0b896", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210055265694Z", "elapsed_seconds": 131.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:03:07.032507+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c59fb45d5b1be7adad26dfe91a8aec767af512c0f8e9ff1942dc2a025c0ad98a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885